{"unit_id": "tag:02J2:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>是一个概形（scheme）。有\n<MATHSEG_0001>开（open）<MATHSEG_0002>\n其中<MATH_0002>是由<MATH_0003>的闭点（closed points）组成的集合（set）。\n这里可令<MATH_0004>遍历<MATH_0005>的所有开集（opens），或遍历其所有仿射开集（affine opens）。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "open", "target_term": "开"}, {"source_term": "closed points", "target_term": "闭点"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "opens", "target_term": "开集"}, {"source_term": "affine opens", "target_term": "仿射开集"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "引理所设的对象。"}, {"source_term": "open", "target_term": "开", "context": "公式中表述开性条件。"}, {"source_term": "closed points", "target_term": "闭点", "context": "指构成该集合的点。"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合", "context": "指由闭点组成的集合。"}, {"source_term": "opens", "target_term": "开集", "context": "指可以遍历的第一类对象。"}, {"source_term": "affine opens", "target_term": "仿射开集", "context": "指可以遍历的第二类对象。"}], "notes": []}
